offee"]," is available at ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"]," every day for 300g, but the other dishes may appear only randomly on Gus' menu."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff Duration"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["f","Magic_Rock_Candy.png",48]],[["l","魔法糖冰棍","Magic Rock Candy"]],["A rare and powerful candy infused with the essence of the prismatic shard."],["N/A"],["Energy 500Health 225"],[["l","采矿","Mining (+2)"],["l","运气","Luck (+5)"],["l","速度","Speed (+1)"],["l","防御","Defense (+5)"],["l","攻击","Attack (+5)"]],["8m 24s"],["N/A - ",["l","沙漠商人","Purchased"],", ",["l","博物馆","earned"],", or dropped by ",["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"],"s"],["5,000g"]],[[["f","Coffee.png",48]],[["l","咖啡","Coffee"]],["It smells delicious. This is sure to give you a boost."],[["i","(O)433","Coffee Bean ×5"]],["Energy 3Health 1"],[["l","速度","Speed (+1)"]],["1m 23s"],["N/A - ",["l","星之果实酒吧#Permanent Stock","Purchased"]," or produced in a ",["l","小桶","Keg"]],["150g"]],[[["l","蟹黄糕","Crab Cakes"]],["Crab, bread crumbs, and egg formed into patties then fried to a golden brown."],[["i","(O)717","Crab ×1"],["i","(O)246","Wheat Flour ×1"],["i","(O)176","Egg ×1"],["i","(O)247","Oil ×1"]],["Energy 225\nHealth 101"],[["l","速度","Speed (+1)"],["l","防御","Defense (+1)"]],["16m 47s"],["The Queen of Sauce (21 Fall, Year 2)"],["275g"]],[[["l","爆炒青椒","Pepper Poppers"]],["Spicy breaded peppers filled with cheese."],[["i","(O)260","Hot Pepper ×1"],["i","(O)424","Cheese ×1"]],["Energy 130\nHealth 58"],[["l","耕种","Farming (+2)"],["l","速度","Speed (+1)"]],["7m"],[["l","谢恩","Shane"]," (Mail - 3+ ❤)"],["200g"]],[[["l","香辣鳗鱼","Spicy Eel"]],["It's really spicy! Be careful."],[["i","(O)148","Eel ×1"],["i","(O)260","Hot Pepper ×1"]],["Energy 115\nHealth 51"],[["l","运气","Luck (+1)"],["l","速度","Speed (+1)"]],["7m"],[["l","乔治","George"]," (Mail - 7+ ❤)"],["1